      "message": "It seems confusing when there\u0027s no active unicast group but the unicast client still gets Resume requests. If there\u0027s abroadcast or more abstract concept like hal listening mode context to this, then this at least needs an explanation comment or putting this logic inside the properly named function. Otherwise this piece of code is confusing.",
