      "writtenOn": "2023-11-14T15:00:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is the place and moment when Broadcast is \"Active\" and there is no active Unicast group, but only Sink HAL session is \"listening\". In such scenario a resume request comes on Sink Audio HAL. This particular case means that there would be requested a invalid group change. Invalid group change request in broadcasting context means a request \"from\" invalid to some, in this case (for broadcast handover) some group would be a previously active (the one that were active before broadcasting).\n\nI agree that here would be nice to have a comment. I\u0027ll update it - thanks for pointing this out.",
